{layout '../layouts/main.latte'}

{block content}
<table class='maintable'>
<tr class='headline'><td><center>Select Player to challenge</center></td></tr>
<tr class='mainrow'><td>
<p>This is how challenging other player work. If you win, you gain 1/10 of the other playerr's skillpoints(so it makes no sense
to challenge someone with less than 10 skillpoints) and the other player dies and loses 1/3 of his skill pts and has to revive.
However, if you lose, he gains 1/10 of your skill points and you die and lose 1/3 of your skill pts.
</p><br>Type the ID# of the player you wish to challenge:<br>
<form method='post' action=''>
<input type='text' name='playerID' class='inline_text_inp' style='width:75px;'><br>
<input type='submit' name='submit2' value='challenge' class='RedButton' style='width:93px'></form>
</td></tr></table><br><br>

{if $resultMessage}
{$resultMessage|noescape}
{/if}
{/block}
